{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/NavigationBasics","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/navigationbasics"]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouterModel","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/BaseRouterModel","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/BaseRouter","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/PresentationModel"],"anchor":"Navigation","generated":true,"title":"Navigation"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/Router"},{"type":"text","text":" is your primary interface for programmatic navigation. Every "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RoutingView"},{"type":"text","text":" creates its own router, accessible via the SwiftUI environment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Accessing the Router","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessing-the-Router"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property wrapper to access the router:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    ","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Navigate\") {","            router.push(HomeRoute.detail(id: 42))","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Push Navigation","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Push-Navigation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Push adds a route to the navigation stack with a standard slide animation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Push a new route","router.push(HomeRoute.detail(id: 42))","","\/\/ Using NavigationLink","NavigationLink(route: HomeRoute.detail(id: 42)) {","    Text(\"View Details\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"NavigationLink Behavior","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"NavigationLink-Behavior"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink(route:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is push-only (stack navigation), because it uses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink(value:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with route values."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Important notes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It must be used inside a ","type":"text"},{"code":"RoutingView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" configured with a matching ","type":"text"},{"code":"RouteDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It does not perform modal presentation, even if the route has a modal ","type":"text"},{"code":"routingType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For modal flows, prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.present(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.cover(...)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Modal Presentations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Modal-Presentations"},{"text":"Sheet","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Sheet"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Present a route as a modal sheet:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ With navigation stack (default)","router.present(HomeRoute.settings)","","\/\/ Without navigation stack","router.present(HomeRoute.settings, withStack: false)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":"withStack: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the presented destination needs direct sheet modifiers such as:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".presentationDetents([.medium])",".presentationDragIndicator(.visible)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withStack: true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the route is wrapped in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RoutingView"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":", which can make these modifiers less predictable on the final destination view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Full-Screen Cover","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Full-Screen-Cover"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Present a route as a full-screen cover:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.cover(HomeRoute.onboarding)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Navigating Back","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Navigating-Back"},{"text":"Back One Step","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Back-One-Step"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Remove the top route from the stack:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.pop()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Pop to Root","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Pop-to-Root"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Return to the root of the navigation stack:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.popToRoot()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Close Modal","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Close-Modal"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Dismiss a presented sheet or cover:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.close()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only works on routers that are presented (sheets or covers).","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"text":"Updating the Root","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Updating-the-Root"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Replace the current root route:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.update(root: HomeRoute.dashboard)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is useful for scenarios like switching between logged-in and logged-out states."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Using routingType","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Using-routingType"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Instead of calling specific methods, you can use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"route(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" which respects the route’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"routingType"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ This will use the route's defined routingType","router.route(HomeRoute.settings)","","\/\/ Equivalent to checking routingType and calling the appropriate method","switch route.routingType {","case .push: router.push(route)","case .sheet: router.present(route)","case .cover: router.cover(route)","case .root: router.update(root: route)","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For routes that require sheet presentation customizations (","type":"text"},{"code":"presentationDetents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"presentationDragIndicator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), prefer:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var routingType: RoutingType { .sheet(withStack: false) }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Router Properties","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Router-Properties"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The router provides useful properties for UI decisions:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Check if this router is presented as a modal","if router.isPresented {","    Button(\"Close\") { router.close() }","}","","\/\/ Get the current route","let current = router.currentRoute","","\/\/ Check navigation depth","if router.routeCount > 1 {","    Button(\"Back\") { router.pop() }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Injecting Router into ViewModels","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Injecting-Router-into-ViewModels"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For MVVM architectures, inject the router using "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouterModel"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class DetailViewModel: ObservableObject {","    private let router: any RouterModel","    ","    init(router: any RouterModel) {","        self.router = router","    }","    ","    func goToSettings() {","        router.present(HomeRoute.settings)","    }","}","","struct DetailView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    @StateObject private var viewModel: DetailViewModel","    ","    init() {","        \/\/ Note: Initialize in onAppear or use a factory","    }","    ","    var body: some View {","        \/\/ ...","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"App-Level Convenience Overloads (Optional)","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"App-Level-Convenience-Overloads-Optional"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your app uses one main route enum (for example ","type":"text"},{"code":"HomeRoute","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), you can add","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"RouterModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" overloads to improve call-site ergonomics:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["public extension RouterModel {","    @_disfavoredOverload","    func push(_ homeRoute: HomeRoute) {","        push(homeRoute)","    }","","    @_disfavoredOverload","    func update(root homeRoute: HomeRoute) {","        update(root: homeRoute)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.push(HomeRoute.profile)","router.update(root: HomeRoute.home)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.push(.profile)","router.update(root: .home)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this pattern for your main route type only, to keep overload resolution predictable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Closing Child Routers","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Closing-Child-Routers"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When handling deep links or resetting navigation, close all presented modals:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.closeChildren()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This dismisses any sheets or covers presented from this router."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Targeting the Frontmost Router","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Targeting-the-Frontmost-Router"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RoutingView"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment(\\.router)"},{"type":"text","text":" always gives you the router for that view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"But at the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":" App level — where no environment is available — you hold a reference to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the root router directly. In that case, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/BaseRouter\/deepestRouter()"},{"type":"text","text":" to target whichever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"router is actually on screen at the moment the action fires:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","  @State var rootRouter = Router(configuration: .default)","","  var body: some Scene {","    WindowGroup {","      ContentView()","        .environment(rootRouter)","        .onOpenURL { url in","          Task { @MainActor in","            rootRouter.deepestRouter()?.terminate(MyContext())","          }","        }","    }","  }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deepestRouter()"},{"text":" traverses the router tree depth-first, following the last live child at each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"level until it reaches a leaf with no active children. If no child is active, it returns the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receiver itself.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deepestRouter()"},{"type":"text","text":" at dispatch time, not at setup time."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a modal is on screen when the action fires, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deepestRouter()"},{"type":"text","text":" returns that modal’s router"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"terminate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" unwinds through the correct presenter."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiftRouting"}],"title":"Navigation Basics"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting"],["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/FAQ"],["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/Migration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn how to navigate between routes using the Router."}],"references":{"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting":{"title":"SwiftRouting","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc